      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When vetting logistics partners, prioritizing statutory compliance and robust risk mitigation is essential to safeguard your assets during transit. Valid documentation ensures legal accountability and streamlines customs or state border checks, while comprehensive insurance prevents catastrophic financial loss due to accidents or delays.</p>
<p>Understanding these regulatory frameworks allows you to ask movers and packers the right questions, ensuring they adhere to national standards. This due diligence transforms your interaction from a casual inquiry into a professional assessment of their operational integrity and liability management capabilities.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
